#
# registry.Unknown is `ID = iota`, i.e. the zero value: any unset ID IS
# Unknown, so it is produced without any textual reference. It is read
# transitively in production -- String()'s default branch returns "", and
# internal/collect drops a source whose registry label is empty while keeping
# its health accounting. Deleting it would be a behavior change, not a
# cleanup: DockerHub would slide to iota 0, a zero value would render as
# "dockerhub", and that guard would become unreachable. (Renamed from
# SourceUnknown in the go-rulebook C17 model->registry rename.)
constant Unknown
